    "title": "进货预订单",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">新增进货预订单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>（1）路径：底部【进货】-顶部【预订】-右下角【预订】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/5e0433f9281e0ea7314077f29ab26706.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>（2）选择供应商名称，进货商品保存即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/ab93a4a1788404965f64d68b9cc16655.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">修改进货预订单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>在进货预订单列表界面，点击对应的进货预订单进入到进货预订订单详情界面，然后点击底部第二个编辑按钮即可修改进货预订单。</p>\n<p><strong>已经完成的进货预订单不支持修改。</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/843effa00da226744c9ae02b3e32f333.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%E5%92%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">关闭和作废进货预订单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%E5%92%8C%E4%BD%9C%E5%BA%9F%E8%BF%9B%E8%B4%A7%E9%A2%84%E8%AE%A2%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>进入到对应的进货预订单详情界面，然后点击右上角的【...】按钮，然后就可以点击复制本单，关闭和作废单据。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202404/fcd9014666a0795341fcbe69401222dc.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>注意：没有完成的进货预订单才支持作废和关闭，如果已经完成的订单，需要先找到相关的进货单作废后才能关闭和作废进货预订单。</p>\n",
